ork_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p024","text":"穆公二年，楚莊王伐陳，殺夏徴舒。三年，楚莊王圍鄭，鄭降，復釋之。十一年，孫良夫救魯伐齊，復得侵地。穆公卒，子定公臧立。定公十二年卒，子獻公衎立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001568","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"夏徴舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"孫良夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001569","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001568","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"定公臧","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001570","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001570","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m024-0067","start":67,"end":70,"surface":"獻公衎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001571","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p094","text":"景公元年春，陳大夫夏徴舒弒其君靈公。二年，楚莊王伐陳，誅徴舒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m094-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001155","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m094-0006","start":6,"end":12,"surface":"陳大夫夏徴舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m094-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001485","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m094-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m094-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"徴舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p023","text":"十六年，伐陳，殺夏徴舒。徴舒弒其君，故誅之也。已破陳，卽縣之。群臣皆賀，申叔時使齊來，不賀。王問，對曰：「鄙語曰，牽牛徑人田，田主取其牛。徑者則不直矣，取之牛不亦甚乎？且王以陳之亂而率諸侯伐之，以義伐之而貪其縣，亦何以復令於天下！」莊王乃復國陳後。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"夏徴舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"徴舒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001399","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"申叔時","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001902","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001885","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m023-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001885","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-035-guancai","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-035","source_id":"s-shiji-035-guancai","source":{"title":"史記／卷035","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷035","permali